[
  {
    "content_id": "10032001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;耶和华对亚米太的儿子约拿说：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;“你起来前往尼尼微大城，大声警告那里的居民，因为他们的罪恶滔天，已经达到我面前。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;可是，约拿却起身逃往他施，想躲避耶和华。他到了约帕港，找到一艘要开往他施的船，就付了船费，上了船，想和众人一起去他施，好躲避耶和华。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;然而，耶和华使海面起了狂风，滔天巨浪几乎把船打成碎片。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;水手们非常害怕，纷纷呼求自己的神明，又把船上的货物全都抛进海里，以减轻重量。这时候，约拿已下到底舱，躺在那里呼呼大睡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;船长来到约拿身边对他说：“你这个人，怎么这时候还在睡觉！快起来祈求你的神明吧，也许你的神明会怜悯我们，使我们不致灭亡。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;后来，船上的人彼此商量说：“来，我们抽签，看看这场灾难是谁惹来的。”于是他们就抽签，结果抽中了约拿。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;众人问他：“请告诉我们，这场灾难是谁惹来的？你是做什么的？从哪里来？是哪一国、哪一族的人？”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;约拿回答说：“我是希伯来人，我敬畏天上的上帝耶和华，祂创造了海洋和陆地。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;之后，他就把怎样逃避耶和华的事告诉他们。众人知道后，万分恐惧，责问他：“你怎么做出这种事？”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;那时，风浪越来越大，他们便对约拿说：“我们要怎样处置你，才能使风浪平静呢？”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;约拿对他们说：“我知道遭遇这场风暴是因我而起的，你们把我抬起来抛进海里，风浪自然会平静。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;然而船上的人还是拚命划船，希望把船划向岸边，可是没有成功，因为风浪越来越大。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;他们只好呼求耶和华，说：“耶和华啊，求你不要因这个人的性命而毁灭我们，不要因我们杀害无辜的人而怪罪我们，因为你耶和华按自己的旨意行事。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;然后他们把约拿抬起来抛进海里，狂风巨浪立刻就平静了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;众人都极其敬畏耶和华，向祂献祭，并且许愿。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;耶和华安排了一条大鱼把约拿吞下，他在鱼腹里度过了三日三夜。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;约拿在鱼腹中向他的上帝耶和华祷告说：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;“耶和华啊，我遭遇患难的时候向你求告， 你就应允我。 我在阴间的深处呼求你， 你也垂听我的声音。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你把我抛进深海， 抛进大洋的腹地， 洋流围困我， 你的巨浪洪涛淹没我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我心想，我从你面前被赶走， 但我还要再瞻仰你的圣殿。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;波涛吞噬我， 深海围困我， 海草缠绕着我的头。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我下沉到山的根基， 大地的门闩把我永远关住； 然而，我的上帝耶和华啊， 你却把我的性命从深坑中拯救出来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;我的生命渐渐消逝的时候， 我就想起了耶和华。 我的祷告进入你的圣殿， 达到你面前。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;那些信奉虚无神明的人， 背弃了怜爱他们的上帝，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;但我要用感谢的声音向你献祭， 我必还我许的愿， 因为救恩来自耶和华。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;于是，耶和华命令那条鱼， 鱼就把约拿吐到陆地上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;耶和华第二次对约拿说：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;“你起身前往尼尼微大城，向那里的居民宣告我先前吩咐你的话。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;约拿便照耶和华的吩咐前往尼尼微城。尼尼微城很大，要三天才能走遍。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;约拿进城走了一天，宣告说：“再过四十天尼尼微就要毁灭了！”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;尼尼微城的人相信了上帝的话，便宣告禁食，所有的人，无论大小贵贱都披上麻衣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;尼尼微王听到这消息后，便走下宝座，脱下王袍，披上麻衣，坐在炉灰中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;王又向全城颁布通告，说：“王和大臣有令，所有的人都必须禁食，牛羊牲畜都不许吃草也不许喝水。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;人和牲畜都必须披上麻衣，众人要向上帝恳切呼求，改邪归正，停止作恶。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;上帝或许会心生怜悯，收回烈怒，使我们不致灭亡，也未可知。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;上帝看见他们改邪归正，不再作恶，就心生怜悯，没有像所说的那样毁灭他们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;这事令约拿十分不悦，非常恼怒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;他向耶和华祷告说：“耶和华啊，我在家乡的时候岂不早就说过你会这样做吗？我知道你是一位有恩典、好怜悯的上帝，不轻易发怒，充满慈爱，不忍心降灾，所以我才急速逃往他施。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;耶和华啊，求你收回我的性命吧，我死了比活着还好！”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;耶和华对他说：“你这样大发脾气合理吗？”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;约拿出城，在城东为自己搭了一个棚，坐在棚下荫凉处，要看看尼尼微城究竟会怎样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;耶和华上帝安排了一棵蓖麻迅速地长起来，为约拿遮荫，使他的头免受日晒。约拿因有这棵蓖麻而非常欢喜。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;第二天黎明的时候，上帝却安排了一条虫来咬这棵蓖麻，蓖麻就枯萎了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;太阳出来的时候，上帝刮起燥热的东风，烈日把约拿晒得发昏，他就再次求死说：“我死了比活着还好！”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;上帝对约拿说：“你为这棵蓖麻大发脾气合理吗？”约拿回答说：“我就是气死了也合理。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;耶和华说：“这棵蓖麻不是你种的，也不是你栽培的，它在一夜之间长成，又在一夜之间死去，你尚且如此爱惜，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我怎能不爱惜这尼尼微大城呢？城中单是连左右手都分不清的人就有十二万多，还有许多的牲畜。”</p>"
  }
]